    "group": "Harpy",
    "summary": "As the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) in your opponent's turn ends, you may pick one of these options:\n\n- Pick 1 **visible** enemy unit 24\" or less from this unit, other than **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** units, and roll 6 D6: each 3+ inflicts 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on it.\n- Create a **SPORE MINES** unit of D3 models for your army, placing it on the battlefield 6\" or less from this model and over 8\" horizontally from every enemy unit. Only 1 model per turn can use this option.",
